    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Glacier\nYellowsh\nGrand\neton\nAde sahar\nCANI\nOTTANCE\nLOS ANGELES\nPascin\nSUN DIEGO\nUNITED'S MAIN LINE AIRWAY\nLinking All Major Eastern and Pacific Coast\nCities with America's Finest Vacation Lands\nUNITED AIR LINES\nCONNECTING AIR LINES\nDENVER\nNEW YORK\nPHILADELINLA\nN.",
      "UNITED\nAIR LINES\nUNITED'S MAIN\nLINE AIRWAY\nUnited's Mid-Continent route cuts straight\nacross the heart of America and includes\nsome of the world's most famous scenic\nhighlights. The Main Line Airway serves\nmost of the nation's leading summer and\nwinter playgrounds.\nPOST CARD\nPlease address\nand return to\nstewardess who\nwill stamp and\nmail card\nfor you.\n2015.166.1698"
